<template x-if="modal==='backups' && selected"><div class="form-stack">
    <p class="muted">Konfigurasi dibaca dari OLT dan disimpan terenkripsi pada server. Pemantauan menjadwalkan backup setiap 24 jam. Unduhan hanya tersedia untuk Owner.</p>
    <div class="module-toolbar"><button class="btn primary" @click="createBackup()" :disabled="isActive(operation(selected))">Buat backup sekarang</button><button class="btn secondary" @click="loadBackups()">Muat ulang backup</button></div>
    <p class="muted" x-show="isActive(operation(selected))" x-text="operation(selected)?.current_step"></p>
    <div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Dibuat</th><th>Ukuran</th><th>SHA-256</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><template x-for="backup in backups" :key="backup.id"><tr><td x-text="dateTime(backup.created_at)"></td><td x-text="backup.bytes+' byte'"></td><td class="mono" x-text="backup.checksum.slice(0,16)+'…'"></td><td><a class="text-button" :href="'/backups/'+backup.id+'/download'">Unduh konfigurasi</a> <button class="text-button" @click="chooseRestore(backup)" :disabled="restoreBusy">Pulihkan layanan ONU</button></td></tr></template></tbody></table></div>
    <div class="inline-editor form-stack" x-show="restoreBackupId"><h3>Pulihkan layanan ONU dari backup</h3><p class="muted">Pilih ONU yang serial dan posisinya cocok dengan backup. Entri layanan backup dipulihkan; entri tambahan di perangkat tidak dihapus.</p><label>Cari ONU<input x-model.debounce.300ms="restoreQuery" @input.debounce.350ms="searchRestoreOnus()" placeholder="Nama atau serial"></label><label>ONU tujuan<select x-model="restoreOnuId" @change="restorePlan=null"><option value="">Pilih ONU</option><template x-for="onu in restoreRows" :key="onu.id"><option :value="onu.id" x-text="onu.name+' / '+onu.interface"></option></template></select></label><button class="btn secondary" @click="previewRestore()" :disabled="restoreBusy||!restoreOnuId">Pratinjau pemulihan</button><template x-if="restorePlan"><div><p class="muted" x-text="restorePlan.message"></p><pre class="terminal-output" x-text="restorePlan.commands.join('\n')"></pre><button class="btn primary" @click="applyRestore()" :disabled="restoreBusy">Terapkan pemulihan layanan ONU</button></div></template></div>
    <p class="muted" x-show="!backups.length">Belum ada backup perangkat ini.</p>
</div></template>
